    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d82-a4">

                <pb facs="0234" n="228" sameAs="frus:frus1894app2/pg228"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure D.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >United States Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Honolulu,
                                Hawaiian Islands</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1893-01-17"><hi rendition="#italic">January 17,
                        1893</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>A Provisional Government having been duly constituted in the place of the recent
                    Government of Queen Liliukalani, and said Provisional Government being in full
                    possession of the Government buildings, the archives, and the treasury, and in
                    control of the capital of the Hawaiian Islands, I hereby recognize said
                    Provisional Government as the <hi rendition="#italic">de facto</hi> Government
                    of the Hawaiian Islands.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">John L. Stevens</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Envoy Extraordinary and Minister Plenipotentiary of
                            the United States.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
